WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.750
When a monster is Special 
Summoned to your field,

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.460
Princess Pudding and Knight 
Pasta's effects activate!

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.690
Full Stomachs for Everyone!

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:25.300
Mokota was in trouble, 
but he turned the tables!

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.380
Can Halil and Olga's monsters survive 
this flurry of exquisite meals?

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:35.600
Show the duels in the other areas!

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.220
You've only been showing the Jungle Area!

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:41.360
It's fine!  What's wrong 
with only showing Michy?

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.320
That's right!

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.540
They should only show Michy from now on!

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.530
You're wrong!

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:49.490
Yoko!

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:52.120
This is a battle royal.

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:54.500
Michy isn't the only one who's dueling.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.730
They have to show Dennis too!

00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:04.170
Forget Dennis.

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:07.510
I want to know how Yuya and Yuzu are doing.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:09.890
Let's go see them in person.

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:10.360
Yeah!

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.040
Hey, wait up!

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:18.300
Halil's ethnic qualities are also a keeper.

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:24.860
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:30.040
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:33.100
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:37.350
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:40.090
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:42.760
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:45.570
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:56.680
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:02.150
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:07.760
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:11.890
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.830
Repeating Up/Down

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.160
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:25.440
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:28.880
Because I don't want to give up

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:33.880
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:02:34.280 --> 00:02:40.960
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:51.470
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:54.170
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:56.870
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:59.670
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:02.420
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:10.970
Supreme Black Dragon of Rebellion

00:03:18.840 --> 00:03:21.400
You may not exit during the battle royal.

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:22.480
Return to your seats.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:23.630
No way!

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:24.620
Why?

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:26.700
I can't go home?

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.920
That's unusual.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:30.220
I'm sorry.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:35.690
But we're thinking of everyone's safety.

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:37.480
Chairwoman Akaba!

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:42.110
Leo Corporation is using the 
Real Solid Vision System

00:03:42.110 --> 00:03:45.900
outside of a duel stadium for the first time.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.370
We can't have unexpected circumstances.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:51.010
I see.

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:57.850
You won't let anyone enter the Action 
Field area to prevent any accidents.

00:03:58.010 --> 00:04:00.850
Yes.  Thanks for understanding.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:06.160
Aren't you Tatsuya Yamashiro, 
the Junior Class finalist?

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:07.620
Yes.

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:13.170
There will be a match in another 
venue to determine your opponent.

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.830
And Layra will definitely win.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:19.870
I hope you're looking forward 
to tomorrow's finals.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:27.510
Other than the Junior Class, the top eight 
in the Youth Class are also dueling.

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:31.370
It's too bad that we can't show it.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:34.730
All the feeds will eventually be restored,

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:39.960
and you'll learn that the tournament 
is proceeding smoothly.

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:44.620
Just as we planned.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.630
Just as they planned...

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:52.600
My turn!

00:04:52.970 --> 00:04:56.540
I activate Ancient Gear 
Hunting Hound's effect!

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:00.170
You take 600 points of damage!

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:01.220
Darling!

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:01.840
Wait!

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:04.110
But my darling will be defeated!

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.280
Is that really Yuya?

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:17.630
What's going on?

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:21.350
What's with him?

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:23.030
Let's finish him quickly.

00:05:26.110 --> 00:05:28.500
My turn!

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:37.810
Swing again, my soul's pendulum!

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:40.780
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.420
Pendulum Summon!

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:45.090
Come out, my monsters!

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:54.360
Yuya has two dragons!

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:58.330
Xiangke Magician who identifies conflict!

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:02.550
Use your keen power to unite 
different stars into one!

00:06:02.770 --> 00:06:05.560
Xiangke Magician's Pendulum effect!

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:14.000
Once per turn, one Xyz Monster 
gains a Level equal to its Rank.

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:20.200
I change Dark Rebellion Xyz 
Dragon from Rank 4 to Level 4!

00:06:21.490 --> 00:06:22.140
What?

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:24.640
A Xyz Monster has a Level?

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:28.560
Xiangsheng Magician who identifies harmony!

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:32.620
Use your mysterious power to 
hang a star high in the sky!

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:35.300
Xiangsheng Magician's Pendulum effect!

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:41.680
Once per turn, a monster's Level becomes 
the same as another monster's Level.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:46.410
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's 
Level becomes the same

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:49.950
as Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon, making it Level 7!

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.690
So now...

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:54.860
He has two Level 7 monsters.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:55.830
Can it be?

00:06:56.050 --> 00:07:03.200
I overlay Level 7 Odd-Eyes Pendulum 
Dragon and Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:12.940
Dragon with different-colored eyes, 
exterminate your enemies with your black wrath!

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:14.910
Xyz Summon!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.480
Appear, Rank 7!

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:20.420
The dragon with shining eyes of fury!

00:07:20.420 --> 00:07:23.860
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.890
Standard Dimension has this much power?

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:32.260
Darling!

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:43.500
Am I in the Ice Age?

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:49.560
When this glows, I end up 
in an unknown location.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:53.100
But did I now travel to the future?

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:57.870
Thousands of years where humans are extinct-

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:00.010
Wait, there are humans!

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.760
Hey!  You guys!

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:03.740
You're...

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:04.760
Yuya Sakaki!

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:08.050
Don't get my name wrong!

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.580
I'm Hugo!

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:17.470
Since Level 7 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon was 
used to create Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon...

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:22.280
...all your Level 7-or-below 
monsters are destroyed,

00:08:22.700 --> 00:08:25.760
and you take damage equal 
to their attack points.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:31.320
And by using one Overlay Unit,

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:37.590
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon can attack for 
every monster it destroyed this turn.

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:40.060
For every destroyed monster?

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:43.050
Three monsters were destroyed this turn.

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:48.470
Therefore, it can attack 
all three of you directly!

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:59.400
Do it, Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:03.350
Wrath of Rebellion, Strike Disobey!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.600
What is it this time?

00:09:21.940 --> 00:09:25.610
Detecting high level Synchro Summon 
energy in the Iceberg Area!

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:26.580
What?

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.550
Stop being unconscious!

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:35.280
Where am I?  Answer me!

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:36.570
Sheesh...

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:40.560
You were the ones who attacked me.

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:43.230
Isn't there anyone else here?

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:46.080
Hello?

00:09:57.540 --> 00:09:59.570
What's going on inside the temple?

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:02.780
Kurosaki!

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:05.510
He's planning to battle Kurosaki?

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:12.120
Yuya!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.240
Yuya!

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:27.640
Call someone now!

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:31.810
Please!

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:33.270
Okay!

00:10:38.510 --> 00:10:40.620
Here are the finishing touches!

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:44.490
By returning Princess Pudding 
and Knight Pasta to my hand,

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:47.490
one monster is destroyed per card!

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:55.120
The trap card Metabolic 
Storm's effect activates!

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.380
When Royal Cookpal's effect 
destroys your monster,

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:01.670
you take damage equal to its attack points!

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:05.910
Please come again.

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.350
All right!  He won!

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:12.310
Ouch...

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:15.780
Give me your Pendulum Cards!

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:18.160
You didn't do anything!

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:19.750
You're shameless.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:23.370
Thank you.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.200
We're doing great.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.200
Keep it up, partner!

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:29.000
What?  Yuya?

00:11:30.420 --> 00:11:32.870
If you're his partner, then you come too!

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:42.100
We can't see Michy either?

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:44.810
Just when Michy was happy for winning!

00:11:45.110 --> 00:11:47.930
According to reports,

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:54.460
people who aren't participating in the 
battle royal have entered the field.

00:11:56.880 --> 00:12:00.390
For an instant, I saw the 
girl who came to my house.

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:05.550
I heard her say "Yuya."

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:09.550
We haven't detected duelists 
in the Iceberg Area.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:15.840
A Synchro signal that powerful means he's 
a duelist from the Synchro Dimension.

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:20.080
If he's the Fusion minion 
that Kurosaki talked about...

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:24.310
Find out where he went!

00:12:24.310 --> 00:12:24.990
Understood!

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:26.880
What about Yuya Sakaki?

00:12:27.480 --> 00:12:32.170
His friends came and moved 
him to the Jungle Area.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:41.870
How did this happen?

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:45.840
I don't know!  It's as if he's possessed!

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:47.980
Don't say that!  That's creepy-

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.620
Why do I have to deal with this?

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:57.550
I'm not friends with him!

00:12:57.550 --> 00:12:59.820
We weren't friends either.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:03.790
But I listened to your wishes 
and teamed up with you.

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:08.730
Because if I stayed with you, I thought I 
could duel many times and hone my skills.

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:12.150
It's your turn to listen to my wishes.

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:15.000
Help me save Yuya!

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:18.820
But even if we want to save him...

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:24.910
The first thing is to find out 
who's possessing my darling.

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:27.000
You can do that?

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.880
I'm Mieru Houchun.

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:33.640
I'm the #1 fortunetelling 
duelist in the school.

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:35.970
With my powers...

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:40.220
Mieru can see it!

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.330
What's wrong?

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:43.800
What did you see?

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:46.770
There are two souls inside my darling!

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.240
Two souls?

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:51.200
No, it's not just two.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:56.180
There's something deeper that's 
trying to overwhelm the two souls.

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:57.640
What is it?

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:03.120
I don't know, but it's terrifying!

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:05.090
Terrifying?

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:07.310
Seriously, stop it-

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:11.480
Yuya!

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:12.280
Yuya!

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.530
Darling!

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:20.600
President, the Fuma ninjas have captured 
Serena and are in the Iceberg Area.

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:22.680
Serena...

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:31.510
Let me go, masked ninja!

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:35.570
How dare you interfere in my battle!

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:36.480
Let me go!

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:40.080
What do you want with me?

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:42.760
I know you're not with them!

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:45.540
Tsukikage, take care of them.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:49.520
The enemies may still be 
nearby.  I'll look around.

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:50.880
Understood, brother.

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:53.930
Who were they?

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:58.410
From what I know, they're from 
Fusion Dimension's Academia.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:14:59.840
Academia?

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:02.540
That means you're Ruri!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:05.010
Did you escape from the Fusion Dimension?

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:07.940
And Academia is chasing you-

00:15:07.940 --> 00:15:11.020
I'm Serena!  My name is not Ruri!

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:12.990
Serena?

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:18.490
It's true that Academia 
sent them to capture me.

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:20.810
But I won't be caught!

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:25.230
Even if this ninja didn't save me, I 
could've drove them away on my own!

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:29.700
Why are they chasing you?

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:34.710
Because I didn't obey the 
Professor's orders, of course!

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:36.680
Professor?

00:15:36.980 --> 00:15:40.840
At Academia, the Professor's 
orders are final.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.360
No one is allowed to disobey them.

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:49.160
But to make him acknowledge my power, 
I intentionally disobeyed his rules.

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:53.630
If I defeat the Xyz refugees 
in the Standard Dimension...

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:59.060
...the Professor will repent for 
not sending me to the front lines!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.360
That's why-

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:02.120
That's why you dueled Dennis.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.690
But I was wrong about him.

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:06.710
I told you so.

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:09.460
So you're also from Academia?

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:12.680
When you say "front lines," 
do you mean the Xyz Dimension?

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:18.680
That's right.  My teammates went to the 
Xyz Dimension and performed spectacularly.

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:22.920
But due to the Professor's 
orders, I was left behind.

00:16:23.140 --> 00:16:26.660
Do you know what Academia 
did to the Xyz Dimension?

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:31.600
Xyz Dimension...  Ruri's 
homeworld was at peace.

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:34.020
Until that day.

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:41.360
On that day, the enemy suddenly attacked 
and turned our city into a battlefield.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:47.310
Academia duelists laughed while 
they attacked the Xyz people.

00:16:47.540 --> 00:16:50.800
As if they were playing a hunting game.

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:14.740
Six assassins arrived from Academia.

00:17:15.160 --> 00:17:16.940
Where are the other three?

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:25.520
Whatever.

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:28.920
Laughing as if it was a game?

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:33.590
Academia duelists wouldn't do such 
silly things on the battlefield!

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:36.060
Are you calling them liars?

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:39.000
Academia has a noble goal!

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.800
To unite the worlds into one!

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:43.500
Worlds into one?

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:46.840
That's why we invaded the Xyz Dimension.

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:52.660
Eventually, we'll absorb Synchro Dimension 
and Standard Dimension to unite the worlds.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:58.520
Academia duelists have been 
trained for this noble goal.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.850
These noble warriors wouldn't 
do what you claimed.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:05.320
They're not noble!  They 
made so many people sad!

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:07.840
Why would they need to be sad?

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:10.840
Xyz duelists have pride too.

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:13.340
Even if they lose their lives in defeat,

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:16.880
if they battled with all their power, 
they should graciously accept it-

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:20.770
You should accept losing your family?

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:25.160
Academia didn't just hurt Xyz duelists.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.710
They also hurt their families and friends!

00:18:27.920 --> 00:18:30.680
Their families aren't duelists?

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:35.460
Kurosaki and Ute are fighting 
to save Kurosaki's sister Ruri

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:39.160
because Academia kidnapped her.

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:41.040
To save her?

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:45.160
Syun Kurosaki is the Xyz 
refugee that you're after.

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:51.100
If you don't believe what I said, 
then you should ask him in person.

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.560
Yuya!

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:03.100
No more occult stuff!

00:19:03.100 --> 00:19:05.220
Michio...  Gongenzaka...

00:19:05.220 --> 00:19:05.950
Darling!

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:08.150
You're...  Mieru?

00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:10.400
He's back!

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:13.860
My darling is back to his usual self!

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:22.960
Thanks to my help, you're back to normal.

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:29.340
By the way, I went all the way to the ocean 
to catch the fish that was in your soup.

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:32.080
You don't need to thank me,

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:36.080
but if you want to, I'll accept 
all your Pendulum Cards-

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:38.820
You're not listening to me!

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:47.760
I remember that Academia duelists suddenly 
appeared and turned the Knight of Duels into...

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:50.480
The defeated are turned into cards?

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:51.700
No way!

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:55.280
I don't know what happened afterwards.

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:57.440
Did I defeat them?

00:19:57.660 --> 00:20:01.470
Yeah.  You Xyz Summoned a 
dragon I've never seen before.

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:03.440
A dragon you've never seen before?

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.620
I can't see it anymore.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:08.080
My darling is his usual self.

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:10.680
A little while ago,

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:15.890
I was able to see another soul and a 
black shadow hiding further beyond.

00:20:16.100 --> 00:20:18.640
Another soul inside me?

00:20:18.980 --> 00:20:21.200
I can't believe it.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.180
Is it possible that you're wrong?

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:25.860
No... but I can't say for sure.

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:30.460
Can it be Ute?

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:32.340
Are you inside me?

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:38.160
Is that why I saw the 
people of Xyz Dimension?

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:42.220
Is your anger controlling me?  But...

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:44.900
Make people smile by dueling.

00:20:45.600 --> 00:20:48.900
You said that and entrusted 
me with this card.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:50.260
So why?

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:55.520
Fine.

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:59.370
I'll meet Kurosaki, the duelist 
from the Xyz Dimension,

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:02.070
and verify if you're telling the truth.

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:06.040
Oh yeah!  Let's also swap clothes.

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:07.500
Clothes?

00:21:07.710 --> 00:21:12.010
You don't want Academia to find 
you before you meet Kurosaki.

00:21:12.220 --> 00:21:16.950
I see.  You'll be my decoy 
and draw their attention.

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:17.880
Exactly.

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:18.860
Fine!

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:20.970
Wait a second!

00:21:20.970 --> 00:21:22.330
Why?

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:24.840
Because!

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:29.770
Let's change.

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:30.600
Yeah.

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:32.570
Hear me?  We're changing!

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:33.310
Understood.

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:41.970
Good!

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:49.760
Kurosaki wasn't at the volcano 
or the jungle, so that leaves...

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:51.220
The ancient ruins.

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:02.820
Oh, it's you.

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:06.060
I was getting tired waiting for you.

00:22:08.060 --> 00:22:09.440
Joeri.

00:22:28.300 --> 00:22:32.940
As long as there's a smile

00:22:35.180 --> 00:22:39.710
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:42.150 --> 00:22:45.020
I always believe

00:22:45.190 --> 00:22:48.540
In my tomorrow

00:22:48.890 --> 00:22:54.170
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:22:57.430 --> 00:23:02.800
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:02.800 --> 00:23:09.680
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:09.840 --> 00:23:16.350
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:20.420
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:48.870
That Duel Disk means you're 
from the Fusion Dimension!

00:23:49.600 --> 00:23:55.310
Serena must meet Kurosaki to learn 
what happened in the Xyz Dimension.

00:23:55.310 --> 00:23:58.880
Therefore, I'll draw their attention.

00:23:59.320 --> 00:24:02.510
You're in my way.

00:24:02.510 --> 00:24:05.220
What?  Yuya?

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:10.460
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Joeri with the Chilling Smile

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:13.020
The fun is only getting started!
